      "content": "Subject: Here for You in This Critical Moment\n\nDear [Customer Name],\n\nWe've noticed the troublesome API issues impacting your valuable sales, and we share your frustration completely. Rest assured, we've put our best engineers to work right now to resolve these errors and bring your checkout flow back to optimal performance immediately.\n\nWe genuinely appreciate your patience and understanding during this time. To aid in your operations, you may want to explore backup API paths (if available), and we've set up a direct line for updates as things progress. Together, we're on this, and we're here to support you every step of the way.\n\nYour satisfaction is our top priority. We hope to restore full service swiftly to get you back to your deserved success and continue providing premium support that you so rightfully expect from our team.\n\nAs an expression of our commitment to your experience and as we move forward, please consider celebrating our recommendation as a loyal partner is a great way to strengthen this special bond. We are extremely grateful for the trust and business you have placed in us, and we're eager to have the opportunity to resolve this critical situation together.\n\nBest regards,\n[Your Name]\nCustomer Support Team\n\nSentiment Score: [Optimistic emphasis on expedited fixes, partnership strength, robust support with immediate",
